matlab/ResampleMesh2Icosphere_FreeSurfer.m -- PROVENANCE UNRESOLVED

This function was inherited by the present author rather than written from
scratch, and its original authorship is not settled. The evidence:

  - the version it was adapted from carried no authorship header;
  - it depended on a MATLAB toolbox and a shell wrapper kept under
    .../shi/spectrum/jiazhang/Codes/ on the originating cluster
    (Matlab_Modules/, Freesurfer_Scripts/mri_surf2ico.sh, ic<order>.tri);
  - the driver script that called it passed seven arguments, while the copy in
    hand takes eight -- the extra `scan` argument was added to fit this
    project's <subject>/<scan>/surf layout. So a seven-argument original by
    someone else almost certainly exists.

